        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our initiative to be the leading next-generation platform provider, we provide an advanced media platform with various media content and service offerings.",
        "start_character": 52900,
        "end_character": 53066
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we are a member company of the SK Group, which is a large business group as designated by the KFTC, we are subject to the following restrictions under the Fair Trade Act:",
        "start_character": 85050,
        "end_character": 85228
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we are a network service provider, and the exception for the foreign shareholding limit under the Telecommunications Business Act does not apply to us, foreign governments, individuals, and entities (including Korean entities that are deemed foreigners, as discussed below) are prohibited from owning more than 49.0% of our voting stock.",
        "start_character": 99370,
        "end_character": 99715
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, under the MSIT guidelines, we are required to offer a discount of between 35.0% to 50.0% of our monthly fee for wireless telecommunications services to handicapped and low-income citizens.",
        "start_character": 98171,
        "end_character": 98370
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the Tbroad Merger, we have been offering cable TV services under the “B tv Cable” brand with access to as many as 226 channels.",
        "start_character": 54901,
        "end_character": 55038
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, for certain rate plan subscribers, we offer unlimited access to the wavve video streaming service and the Flo music streaming service through our “wavve and Data Plus” plan and “Flo and Data Plus” plan, respectively, at no additional cost, at a discounted rate or at the standard rate, depending on the subscribers’ basic rate plan.",
        "start_character": 36764,
        "end_character": 37109
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we provide services to transmit and store extensive data accumulated in manufacturing processes of our customers through our ultra-high speed and ultra-low latency connectivity solutions.",
        "start_character": 23668,
        "end_character": 23868
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our residential customers, we offer both bundled rate plans for a combination of our fixed-line service offerings as well as individual rate plans for each separate service offering.",
        "start_character": 58028,
        "end_character": 58214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2025, we entered into an agreement to sell our entire equity stake in SK Stoa, which operates our T-commerce business, and Media S to Rapport Labs Inc., a Korea-based e-commerce company, as part of our ongoing strategy to streamline and optimize our overall business portfolio.",
        "start_character": 55613,
        "end_character": 55902
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our cellular services and wireless device sales businesses, we provide a variety of other innovative technological solutions and services by leveraging our capabilities in telecommunications, AI and ICT technologies, and we are continuing to invest in these and other emerging new business areas, including the following:",
        "start_character": 22216,
        "end_character": 22552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-188763",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-188763-a49687aa1b0d65a7",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-188763",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our core telecommunications services, we offer a broad range of complementary services and solutions that leverage our telecommunications platforms and digital infrastructure capabilities.",
